You say you don't see the SRM console prompt.  What do you
see?

If you see AlphaBIOS, then there's a place in the menus to
switch to SRM if your machine has SRM installed.  There
should also be a place to update the firmware to install SRM
if it isn't already there.

If SRM is actually already there and live, it might be
talking to the serial port rather than the graphics
console.  If so, hook up a serial terminal (or emulator) and
do

    set console graphics
    set os_type unix

If the above does not help (as is very likely), a little
more detail on what you actually have would help improve the
suggestions.

