Connect a serial line from the com port of a pc to the serial port on the
miata,  then use one of the terminal emulators to establish a connection,
you should see your srm console prompt ">>>"

then to a "set console graphics" without quotes, then init

You should see your srm on the graphics terminal when it restarts.

When updating SRM via network mop load or a floppy image,  it defaults to
"serial console mode"..   We did this on purpose. in MFG we ran all the
diags through the serial console and updated the firmware if needed, so we
always wanted it to come back to the serial port.

JJ
